00:13:32.307 --> 00:13:34.237
- [Voiceover] Austin asks: "Hey GaryVee,

00:13:34.237 --> 00:13:36.523
"I'm a sales consultant for
Best Buy selling computers.

00:13:36.523 --> 00:13:38.044
