00:13:38.044 --> 00:13:40.064
"a better salesman?"

00:13:40.064 --> 00:13:42.188
- Austin, I think you
need to reverse engineer

00:13:42.188 --> 00:13:43.535
who you're selling to.

00:13:43.535 --> 00:13:45.265
So, if I were you, Austin, I would spend

00:13:45.265 --> 00:13:50.072
all of January taking people
out to lunch and dinner

00:13:50.072 --> 00:13:51.954
or a drink, or getting them on the phone,

00:13:51.954 --> 00:13:54.764
but literally spending the
entire month of January

00:13:54.764 --> 00:13:57.770
not selling to people, and
just listen to the people

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.625
that you sell to to find out
what their pain points are.

00:14:00.625 --> 00:14:02.262
I would walk in and be like, hey DRock.

00:14:02.262 --> 00:14:03.785
You know I sell you computer stuff

00:14:03.785 --> 00:14:05.002
and things of that nature.

00:14:05.002 --> 00:14:05.791
What are your pain points?

00:14:05.791 --> 00:14:06.511
What's your problem?

00:14:06.511 --> 00:14:07.881
What's your struggles in your business?

00:14:07.881 --> 00:14:09.832
Like, let's cut the crap.

00:14:09.832 --> 00:14:11.945
Yes, I want to sell to you,
but let's take a step back.

00:14:11.945 --> 00:14:14.046
I want to sell to you by providing you

00:14:14.046 --> 00:14:15.219
some sort of value.

00:14:15.219 --> 00:14:16.322
Maybe I have a friend.

00:14:16.322 --> 00:14:18.679
Maybe I will recommend that
you watch the #AskGaryVee show

00:14:18.679 --> 00:14:19.921
to make your business better.

00:14:19.921 --> 00:14:21.593
Maybe I will do a lot of
things, but what I'm doing

00:14:21.593 --> 00:14:23.624
is I'm providing you
value, and our conversation

00:14:23.624 --> 00:14:24.878
and our relationship is not just

00:14:24.878 --> 00:14:27.990
predicated on me selling.

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.824
You know, I was talking
to one of my friends,

00:14:29.824 --> 00:14:31.299
